>Our team operates at the forefront of innovation, employing the latest Amazon strategies and conducting thorough analyses of the current market dynamics.</p></div><div class="trust-item"><div id="trust3" class="trust-icon"></div><h3 class="title-medium">Legal and Financial Guidance</h3><p class="desc">We are partners with the leading law and accounting firms that will arrange legal paperwork, ensuring smooth asset transition.</p></div><div class="trust-item"><div id="trust4" class="trust-icon"></div><h3 class="title-medium">Time and Stress Reduction</h3><p class="desc">Our team consistently secures a buyer 64% faster than independent searches. Lock in the best deal with no hassle.</p></div><div class="trust-item"><div id="trust5" class="trust-icon"></div><h3 class="title-medium">Dedicated Post-Sale Support</h3><p class="desc">You’ll receive 60 days of dedicated post-sale support. Our commitment extends beyond the sale, ensuring an ongoing assistance if any needs arise.</p></div><div class="trust-item"><div id="trust6" class="trust-icon"></div><h3 class="title-medium">Confidentiality Management</h3><p class="desc">Your privacy is our top priority. We ensure a seamless business sale by implementing a NDA to avoid any unnecessary attention.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="network"><div class="container" data-header-nav="dark"><div class="section-desc">Save your time</div><div class="network-container"><h2 class="title-large">We have a closed <span class="text-gradient">network</span> of Amazon FBA buyers</h2><p class="desc">Our exclusive network of Amazon FBA buyers, actively seeking compelling businesses, ensures you bypass the lengthy search for a suitable buyer, saving you months or even years.</p></div></div><div class="network-video-wrapper"><div class="network-parallax"><video class="network-video" playsinline autoplay loop="loop" muted><source src="img/network-video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div></div></section><section class="calculator" data-header-nav="dark"><div class="calculator-wrapper" id="calculator"><div class="calculator-left"><h2 class="title-large">Thinking of selling a business <span class="text-gradient">now</span> or later?</h2><p class="desc">You never know how much your business might be worth. Use our business value calculator tailored to your responses and find out.</p><button class="button" data-action="calculator" aria-label="Open form - calculate business price"><span>Calculate the price</span> <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8.66657 11.0568L12.6666 7.05681L13.6094 7.99962L8.4713 13.1377L7.52849 13.1377L2.39042 7.99962L3.33323 7.05681L7.33323 11.0568L7.33323 2.66629L8.66657 2.66629L8.66657 11.0568Z"/><path d="M8.66657 11.0568L12.6666 7.05681L13.6094 7.99962L8.4713 13.1377L7.52849 13.1377L2.39042 7.99962L3.33323 7.05681L7.33323 11.0568L7.33323 2.66629L8.66657 2.66629L8.66657 11.0568Z"/></svg></button><div class="calculator-right"><div class="calculator-circle calculator-circle-big"><div class="calculator-circle-content"><div class="title-extraLarge">82%</div><div class="calculator-circle-desc">of business owners don’t realize real value of their business</div></div><img src="img/calculator-ellipse.svg" alt="Prime Exits - Calculate Price" class="calculator-ellipse"> <img src="img/calculator-ellipse-small.svg" alt="Prime Exits - Calculate Price" class="calculator-ellipse calculator-ellipse-small"></div><div class="calculator-circle calculator-circle-small"><div class="calculator-circle-content"><div class="title-medium">18%</div><div class="calculator-circle-desc">of business owners know real value of their business</div></div><img src="img/calculator-ellipse.svg" alt="Prime Exits - Calculate Price" class="calculator-ellipse"></div></div><div class="calculator-disclaimer">No personal data is needed. Check your real business value.</div></div></div></section><section class="strategy" data-header-nav="dark"><div class="container"><div class="section-desc section-desc-mob">Choose exit strategy</div><div class="strategy-media-container"><figure class="strategy-media-item"><img src="img/exit-quickSale.jpg" alt="Prime Exits - Amazon FBA Quick Sale"></figure><figure class="strategy-media-item"><img src="img/exit-rampUp.jpg" alt="Prime Exits - Amazon FBA Sale Ramp Up"></figure><figure class="strategy-media-item"><img src="img/exit-longRun.jpg" alt="Prime Exits - Amazon FBA Sale Long Run"></figure></div><div class="strategy-content"><div class="strategy-content-top"><div class="section-desc">Choose exit strategy</div><nav class="strategy-nav"><div class="strategy-button"><span class="strategy-text">Quick Sale</span><p class="strategy-desc">For businesses with everything in place and no need for a ramp-up. Exit time: 3 to 6 months.</p><div class="strategy-progress"><div class="strategy-progress-current"></div></div></div><div class="strategy-button"><span class="strategy-text">Ramp Up</span><p class="strategy-desc">For businesses that need additional help scaling Amazon before exit to maximize value. Exit time: 6 to 9 months.</p><a class="strategy-link-mob" href="https://prime-clicks.com/" target="_blank" aria-label="PrimeClicks marketing offer"><span>View PrimeClicks marketing offer</span></a></div><div class="strategy-button"><span class="strategy-text">Long Run</span><p class="strategy-desc">For those aiming to grow their business before considering a sale. Exit time: 9 to 24 months.</p><a class="strategy-link-mob" href="https://prime-clicks.com/" target="_blank" aria-label="PrimeClicks marketing offer"><span>View PrimeClicks marketing offer</span></a></div></nav></div><div class="strategy-info"><div class="strategy-info-item"><div class="desc-large">Exit time: 3 to 6 months</div><p class="desc">For businesses with everything in place and no need for a ramp-up.</p><a class="strategy-info-link" href="https://prime-clicks.com/" target="_blank" aria-label="PrimeClicks marketing offer"><span>View PrimeClicks marketing offer</span></a></div><div class="strategy-info-item"><div class="desc-large">Exit time: 6 to 9 months</div><p class="desc">For businesses that need additional help scaling Amazon before exit to maximize value.</p><a class="strategy-info-link" href="https://prime-clicks.com/" target="_blank" aria-label="PrimeClicks marketing offer"><span>View PrimeClicks marketing offer</span></a></div><div class="strategy-info-item"><div class="desc-large">Exit time: 9 to 24 months</div><p class="desc">For those aiming to grow their business before considering a sale.</p><a class="strategy-info-link" href="https://prime-clicks.com/" target="_blank" aria-label="PrimeClicks marketing offer"><span>View PrimeClicks marketing offer</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="case" data-header-nav="dark"><div class="container" id="case"><div class="section-desc">Successful story</div><div class="case-left"><div class="title-large">Meet <span class="text-gradient">Steve</span></div><p class="desc">Seasoned 7-figure Amazon seller based in US</p></div><div class="case-pic-container"><img class="case-pic" src="img/case-1.jpg" alt="Prime Exits - Amazon FBA business sale case"></div><div class="case-right"><p class="desc">Steve, who sells kitchen appliances on Amazon, found himself feeling burnt out and was looking to spend more time with his family and focus on other projects.</p><a href="story.html" class="button" aria-label="Read client's case"><span>Read the story</span> <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8.66657 11.0568L12.6666 7.05681L13.6094 7.99962L8.4713 13.1377L7.52849 13.1377L2.39042 7.99962L3.33323 7.05681L7.33323 11.0568L7.33323 2.66629L8.66657 2.66629L8.66657 11.0568Z"/><path d="M8.66657 11.0568L12.6666 7.05681L13.6094 7.99962L8.4713 13.1377L7.52849 13.1377L2.39042 7.99962L3.33323 7.05681L7.33323 11.0568L7.33323 2.66629L8.66657 2.66629L8.66657 11.0568Z"/></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="flow" data-header-nav="dark"><div class="flow-header" id="flow"><div class="section-desc">Exit Flow</div><h2 class="title-large">Eight steps to a <span class="text-gradient">successful</span> exit</h2></div><div class="flow-wrapper"><div class="flow-content"><div class="flow-item"><img src="img/flow-icon-1.svg" alt="Amazon Business Evaluation - Prime Exits" class="flow-icon-mob"><div class="flow-number">01</div><div class="flow-item-info"><h3 class="title-medium">Business Evaluation</h3><p class="desc">Conducting a thorough evaluation of the business, auditing the Amazon account, financial statements, competitors and relevant data.</p></div></div><div class="flow-item"><img src="img/flow-icon-2.svg" alt="Amazon Business Ramp Up - Prime Exits" class="flow-icon-mob"><div class="flow-number">02</div><div class="flow-item-info"><h3 class="title-medium">Business Ramp Up</h3><p class="desc">If scaling is required to achieve the desired business value, taking over the account to improve overall performance.</p></div></div><div class="flow-item"><img src="img/flow-icon-3.svg" alt="Amazon Paperwork Organization - Prime Exits" class="flow-icon-mob"><div class="flow-number">03</div><div class="flow-item-info"><h3 class="title-medium">Paperwork Organization</h3><p class="desc">Meticulously arranging essential documentation, including profit and loss statements, accounting reports and creative assets.</p></div></div><div class="flow-item"><img src="img/flow-icon-4.svg" alt="Amazon Exit Compelling Pitch Deck - Prime Exits" class="flow-icon-mob"><div class="flow-number">04</div><div class="flow-item-info"><h3 class="title-medium">Compelling Pitch Deck</h3><p class="desc">Crafting a professionally designed presentation showcasing the business to potential buyers, highlighting key features to increase its value and attract the best offers.</p></div></div><div class="flow-item"><img src="img/flow-icon-5.svg" alt="Amazon Listing the Business - Prime Exits" class="flow-icon-mob"><div class="flow-number">05</div><div class="flow-item-info"><h3 class="title-medium">Listing the Business</h3><p class="desc">Listing your business for sale, inviting initial offers from potential buyers, and making necessary adjustments for optimal outcomes and enhanced overall value.</p></div></div><div class="flow-item"><img src="img/flow-icon-6.svg" alt="Amazon Buyer Selection - Prime Exits" class="flow-icon-mob"><div class="flow-number">06</div><div class="flow-item-info"><h3 class="title-medium">Buyer Selection</h3><p class="desc">Assessing potential buyers includes reaching out through initial calls to identify those with genuine interest and favourable terms, ensuring a smooth business transition.</p></div></div><div class="flow-item"><img src="img/flow-icon-7.svg" alt="Amazon Price Negotiation - Prime Exits" class="flow-icon-mob"><div class="flow-number">07</div><div class="flow-item-info"><h3 class="title-medium">Price Negotiation</h3><p class="desc">Strategic negotiations with the selected buyers to secure the highest price possible, prioritizing your financial and strategic interests throughout the process.</p></div></div><div class="flow-item"><img src="img/flow-icon-8.svg" alt="Amazon Business Transition - Prime Exits" class="flow-icon-mob"><div class="flow-number">08</div><div class="flow-item-info"><h3 class="title-medium">Business Transition</h3><p class="desc">Comprehensive support in transferring assets to the buyer, ensuring a smooth and efficient process from start to finish as well as ongoing assistance just in case.</p><div class="flow-item-lottieEnd"></div></div></div></div><div class="flow-icon-wrapper"><div class="flow-icon-container"><div class="flow-icon"></div></div></div></div><div class="flow-progress-wrapper"><div class="flow-progress"><div class="flow-progress-current"></div><div class="flow-progress-pin"></div></div></div></section><section class="contact" data-header-nav="dark"><div class="contact-wrapper"><div class="contact-line-wrapper"><div class="contact-line"><div class="contact-line-content